  "T16小秘境、蓝门与悬赏使用金织带、囤宝者和贪婪之戒组成金币链，配瑞秋戒与寅剑把赶路和冷却压到最低。；伤害溢出后把宝石与词缀转向移速、冷却和拾取范围；高巅峰尝试接近110层时可换团结提容错。": {
    "enUS": "For T16 [[General/LootRunPortal]], blue portals and bounties, combine [[Items/Unique_Belt_010_x1]], [[Items/Unique_Gem_014_x1]] and [[Items/Unique_Ring_108_x1]] for the gold setup, with [[Items/Unique_Ring_104_x1]] and [[Items/Unique_Sword_1H_113_x1]] to minimize travel time and cooldowns. Once damage is sufficient, prioritize movement speed, cooldown reduction and pickup radius in gems and affixes. At high Paragon, consider [[Items/Unique_Ring_010_x1]] for survivability when approaching tier 110."
  },
  "提丰多头蛇的核心武器/副手/套装乘区不可随意替换；缺少它时只算过渡配装。": {
    "enUS": "The core weapon, off-hand and set multipliers of the Typhon Hydra build cannot be freely replaced; a setup missing this item is only transitional."
