  "亡者领域内高速吞噬，瞬间叠满后续尸枪乘区。": {
    "enUS": "Use [[Powers/P6_Necro_Devour_name]] rapidly during [[Powers/P6_Necro_LandOfTheDead_name]] to instantly build the multiplier for subsequent Corpse Lance attacks."
  },
  "少任意一件都会明显变脆；团结随从没有不死圣物时反而会断减伤。": {
    "enUS": "Missing any piece significantly reduces survivability. With [[Items/Unique_Ring_010_x1]], a follower without an immortality relic can interrupt the damage reduction setup."
  },
  "速刷时替换冲层武器": {
    "enUS": "Replace the pushing weapon for speed farming."
  },
  "翻滚后获得减伤。": {
    "enUS": "Gain damage reduction after [[Powers/DemonHunter_Vault_name]]."
  },
  "烟雾弹后获得减伤。": {
    "enUS": "Gain damage reduction after [[Powers/DemonHunter_SmokeScreen_name]]."
  },
  "每个受到诅咒的敌人都会提高你的伤害；怪群越密，脆弱光环的增伤越高。": {
    "enUS": "Each cursed enemy increases your damage; denser groups make the damage boost from the [[Powers/P6_Necro_Frailty_name]] aura stronger."
  },
  "飓风破后获得减伤。": {
    "enUS": "Gain damage reduction after [[Powers/Monk_CycloneStrike_name]]."
  },
  "魔女冷却最通用；冲层若需要暴击爆发可换盗贼，低巅峰缺治疗时可换圣殿骑士。": {
    "enUS": "The cooldown benefit from the [[Pets/HirelingEnchantress]] is the most versatile. For pushing, use the [[Pets/HirelingScoundrel]] if you need critical-hit burst; at low Paragon, use the [[Pets/HirelingTemplar]] if you need [[Powers/Templar_Heal_110_name]]."
  },
  "疾风击后获得减伤。": {
    "enUS": "Gain damage reduction after [[Powers/X1_Monk_DashingStrike_name]]."
  },
  "速刷时替换全能法戒": {
    "enUS": "Replace [[Items/P2_Unique_Ring_04]] for speed farming."
  },
  "速刷时替换杰瑟斯骨镰": {
    "enUS": "Replace [[Items/P6_Unique_Scythe1H_04]] for speed farming."
  },
  "速刷时替换杰瑟斯骨盾": {
    "enUS": "Replace [[Items/P6_Unique_Shield_01]] for speed farming."
  },
  "结束后建立增伤": {
    "enUS": "Build the damage boost after it ends."
  },
  "T16速刷把腰带换金织带、护腕换复仇者、戒指换贪婪组成金币链；第4槽换寅剑或梅斧压缩亡者大军空窗，宝石用困者/勾玉/囤宝者。": {
    "zhCN": "T16速刷把腰带换[[Items/Unique_Belt_010_x1]]、护腕换[[Items/Unique_Bracer_106_x1]]、戒指换[[Items/Unique_Ring_108_x1]]组成金币链；第4槽换[[Items/Unique_Sword_1H_113_x1]]或[[Items/P66_Unique_Axe_2H_011]]压缩[[Powers/P6_Necro_SkeleBomb_name]]空窗，宝石用[[Items/Unique_Gem_002_x1]]/[[Items/Unique_Gem_008_x1]]/[[Items/Unique_Gem_014_x1]]。",
    "zhTW": "T16速刷將腰帶換成[[Items/Unique_Belt_010_x1]]、護腕換成[[Items/Unique_Bracer_106_x1]]、戒指換成[[Items/Unique_Ring_108_x1]]組成金幣鏈；第4槽改用[[Items/Unique_Sword_1H_113_x1]]或[[Items/P66_Unique_Axe_2H_011]]縮短[[Powers/P6_Necro_SkeleBomb_name]]空窗，寶石使用[[Items/Unique_Gem_002_x1]]/[[Items/Unique_Gem_008_x1]]/[[Items/Unique_Gem_014_x1]]。",
    "enUS": "For T16 speed farming, equip [[Items/Unique_Belt_010_x1]], [[Items/Unique_Bracer_106_x1]] and [[Items/Unique_Ring_108_x1]] for the gold setup. Use [[Items/Unique_Sword_1H_113_x1]] or [[Items/P66_Unique_Axe_2H_011]] in slot 4 to reduce [[Powers/P6_Necro_SkeleBomb_name]] downtime, with [[Items/Unique_Gem_002_x1]] / [[Items/Unique_Gem_008_x1]] / [[Items/Unique_Gem_014_x1]] as gems."
  },
